---
import { InstallTabs } from './react/InstallTabs';
import { Reveal } from './react/Reveal';
---

<section id="install" class="scroll-mt-20 border-y border-zinc-200 bg-white dark:border-zinc-800 dark:bg-zinc-900/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl scroll-mt-20 px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 lg:py-24">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-14">
      <Reveal client:visible>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tighter md:text-4xl">安装与启动</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-[60ch] leading-relaxed text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
          用 Skills CLI 一行安装。在编码智能体所在（或指向）的代码库中启动它，说一句话即可进入完整审计。
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6">
          <InstallTabs client:visible />
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed dark:border-zinc-800">
          <p class="font-semibold">输出目录规则</p>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">未指定时默认 <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300">~/security-audit-skill/&lt;repo-name&gt;/run-&lt;N&gt;</code>。只有当你显式选择被版本控制忽略的目录时，才会在目标仓库内写入文件。</p>
        </div>
      </Reveal>
      <Reveal client:visible delay={0.08}>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight">三种启动说法</h3>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
          {[
            ['security audit this codebase', '完整审计当前代码库'],
            ['find security vulnerabilities in ./src', '聚焦 ./src 做漏洞搜寻'],
            ['do a security review, output to ~/audits/my-project', '指定输出目录的评审'],
          ].map(([cmd, desc]) => (
            <li class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 p-4 dark:border-zinc-800">
              <code class="font-mono text-[13px] text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100">“{cmd}”</code>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">{desc}</p>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
        <div class="mt-4 rounded-2xl border border-emerald-600/25 bg-emerald-500/[0.06] p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <p class="font-semibold">触发与模式</p>
          <p class="mt-1.5 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">命中 security audit、find vulnerabilities、pen-test the code 等触发词即自动激活。直接审计进入完整模式；安全咨询与聚焦排查进入指导模式，除非你明确要求报告产物。</p>
        </div>
      </Reveal>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
